          "id": "46cd9f33-89ec-4b5d-a665-1e99c9494cd2",
          "memory": "On September 30, 2026 User said User still had lemon pepper chicken from the prior week and had frozen it to keep it from going bad, after previously finishing reheated leftovers on September 23.",
