        },
        {
          "id": "a261f7a7-3ad5-4098-9ddd-1d4ed4af1532",
          "memory": "On the evening of September 30, 2026 Devon was cooking chicken nuggets in the oven for dinner, which User teased as fancy peak cooking.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "b5aca6fe-318f-4781-9325-6329fccc3834",
          "memory": "User and Devon previously had pizza at Rosa's where they enjoyed the margherita thin crust, and on September 30, 2026 both said they now want something heavier with proper cheesy slices.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "32a24483-872a-4ff1-af0f-a86e81f237fe",
          "memory": "User and Devon agreed on September 30, 2026 to try Mario's on Pine Street for pizza on Friday, October 2, 2026 at 6 PM, with Devon recommending it after his team ordered last week and noting it is a couple blocks past the library with parking in back.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "041ec719-85c3-4602-80af-ede718b8358d",
          "memory": "Devon said on September 30, 2026 that his team dropped the Saturday 2 PM team lunches after everyone complained, following a disappointing Domino's sad team lunch.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "3baed405-6a91-487b-b38f-995dbc79e222",
          "memory": "As of September 30, 2026 User pays the electric bill via autopay and had no late fee that month, with Devon confirming his autopay also went through in what they called an adulting win.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "801c0107-8cc6-435f-b1e2-95da782a3237",
          "memory": "User and Devon each have a cat; on September 30, 2026 Devon's cat was screaming for dinner while User's cat was sitting on clean laundry, with both noting cats always choose the clean load.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "249bee2b-839c-4b88-9933-0e04c969e1a2",
          "memory": "Devon confirmed on September 30, 2026 that he did groceries with his mom over the weekend and they are stocked, following through on helping her Saturday afternoon September 26, 2026.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "08c5680e-6764-42c0-b7b2-3faf97f4fb71",
          "memory": "As of September 30, 2026 Devon's mom is doing well but still asks about User and references the potato salad incident from the September 20, 2026 lunch, and User asked Devon to tell her hi and said User still thinks about that potato salad.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "2919546e-b424-4458-b7dc-d1c1f854bcb0",
          "memory": "Devon said on September 30, 2026 he can leave work on time for the Friday pizza because his boss is out, avoiding last-minute chart hell like the work report his boss kept pinging about.",
